Cell["\<\
matrix must be an exact matrix object from CompileCyclotomicMatrices. The \
function returns \"reduced_matrix\", \"pivot_columns\", \"free_columns\", \
\"rank\", and \"nullity\".\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"20d213ee-f71e-4e84-9476-4cc6fc70bff1"],

Cell["\<\
pivot_columns and free_columns use 0-based indices so that the result has the \
same deterministic convention as the cross-language fixture format. Add one \
when using an index with Wolfram Language Part.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a4dc5446-4c33-48fd-9b06-e6c84859d30c"],

Cell["\<\
The production calculation uses MagneticTB's exact cyclotomic row-reduction \
algorithm. It does not call the built-in RowReduce and does not switch to \
floating point, SVD, or another fallback.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c09a61b3-2a54-4153-bcfd-2bf6e80d2271"]
}, Closed]],

